[
  {
    "path": "years/上古/06-商末与周初.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-6",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-001",
    "number": 6,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p001",
    "quote": "衛康叔名封，周武王同母少弟也。其次尚有冉季，冉季最少。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/上古/06-商末与周初.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-11",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-002",
    "number": 11,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p002",
    "quote": "武王已克殷紂，復以殷餘民封紂子武庚祿父，比諸侯，以奉其先祀勿絕。為武庚未集，恐其有賊心，武王乃令其弟管叔、蔡叔傅相武庚祿父，以和其民。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/上古/06-商末与周初.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-13",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-003",
    "number": 13,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p002",
    "quote": "武王既崩，成王少。周公旦代成王治，當國。管叔、蔡叔疑周公，乃與武庚祿父作亂，欲攻成周。周公旦以成王命興師伐殷，殺武庚祿父、管叔，放蔡叔，以武庚殷餘民封康叔為衛君，居河、淇閒故商墟。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/上古/07-西周的治理与危机.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj037-kang-advice-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-004",
    "number": 19,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p003",
    "quote": "周公旦懼康叔齒少，乃申告康叔曰：「必求殷之賢人君子長者，問其先殷所以興，所以亡，而務愛民。」告以紂所以亡者以淫於酒，酒之失，婦人是用，故紂之亂自此始。為梓材，示君子可法則。故謂之《康誥》、《酒誥》、《梓材》以命之。康叔之國，既以此命，能和集其民，民大說。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/上古/06-商末与周初.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-13",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-005",
    "number": 13,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p004",
    "quote": "成王長，用事，舉康叔為周司寇，賜衛寶祭器，以章有德。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/上古/07-西周的治理与危机.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-11",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-006",
    "number": 11,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p005",
    "quote": "康叔卒，子康伯代立。康伯卒，子考伯立。考伯卒，子嗣伯立。嗣伯卒，子偼伯立。偼伯卒，子靖伯立。靖伯卒，子貞伯立。貞伯卒，子頃侯立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/上古/07-西周的治理与危机.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj037-qing-rank-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-007",
    "number": 20,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p006",
    "quote": "頃侯厚賂周夷王，夷王命衛為侯。頃侯立十二年卒，子釐侯立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/上古/07-西周的治理与危机.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj037-qing-rank-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-008",
    "number": 20,
    "source_path": "sources/史记三家注/卷037.md",
    "source_anchor": "p5",
    "quote": "按：康誥稱命爾侯于東土，又云「孟侯，朕其弟，小子封」，則康叔初封已爲侯也。比子康伯即稱伯者，謂方伯之伯耳，非至子即降爵爲伯也。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0900-0801/bce-0841.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-009",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p007",
    "quote": "釐侯十三年，周厲王出奔于彘，共和行政焉。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0900-0801/bce-0827.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-010",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p007",
    "quote": "二十八年，周宣王立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0900-0801/bce-0813.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj037-xi-death-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-011",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p008",
    "quote": "四十二年，釐侯卒，太子共伯餘立為君。共伯弟和有寵於釐侯，多予之賂；和以其賂賂士，以襲攻共伯於墓上，共伯入釐侯羨自殺。衛人因葬之釐侯旁，謚曰共伯，而立和為衛侯，是為武公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0900-0801/bce-0813.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj037-xi-death-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-012",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/史记三家注/卷037.md",
    "source_anchor": "p7",
    "quote": "和殺恭伯代立，此說蓋非也。按：季札美康叔、武公之德。又國語稱武公年九十五矣，猶箴誡於國，恭恪于朝，倚几有誦，至于沒身，謂之叡聖。又詩著衞世子恭伯蚤卒，不云被殺。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0900-0801/bce-0812.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-013",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p009",
    "quote": "武公即位，修康叔之政，百姓和集。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0800-0701/bce-0771.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-014",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p009",
    "quote": "四十二年，犬戎殺周幽王，武公將兵往佐周平戎，甚有功，周平王命武公為公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0800-0701/bce-0758.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj037-wu-death-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-015",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p009",
    "quote": "五十五年，卒，子莊公揚立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0800-0701/bce-0753.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj037-zhuang-marriage-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-016",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p010",
    "quote": "莊公五年，取齊女為夫人，好而無子。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0800-0701/bce-0740.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj037-zhouyu-command-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-017",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p010",
    "quote": "莊公有寵妾，生子州吁。十八年，州吁長，好兵，莊公使將。石碏諫莊公曰：「庶子好兵，使將，亂自此起。」不聽。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0800-0701/bce-0735.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-018",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p010",
    "quote": "又取陳女為夫人，生子，蚤死。陳女女弟亦幸於莊公，而生子完。完母死，莊公令夫人齊女子之，立為太子。……二十三年，莊公卒，太子完立，是為桓公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0800-0701/bce-0733.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-019",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p011",
    "quote": "桓公二年，弟州吁驕奢，桓公絀之，州吁出奔。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0800-0701/bce-0722.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-020",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p011",
    "quote": "十三年，鄭伯弟段攻其兄，不勝，亡，而州吁求與之友。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0800-0701/bce-0719.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-021",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p011",
    "quote": "十六年，州吁收聚衛亡人以襲殺桓公，州吁自立為衛君。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0800-0701/bce-0719.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-022",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p011",
    "quote": "為鄭伯弟段欲伐鄭，請宋、陳、蔡與俱，三國皆許州吁。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0800-0701/bce-0719.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-6",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-023",
    "number": 6,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p011",
    "quote": "州吁新立，好兵，弒桓公，衛人皆不愛。石碏乃因桓公母家於陳，詳為善州吁。至鄭郊，石碏與陳侯共謀，使右宰丑進食，因殺州吁于濮，",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0800-0701/bce-0719.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-7",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-024",
    "number": 7,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p011",
    "quote": "而迎桓公弟晉於邢而立之，是為宣公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0800-0701/bce-0712.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-10",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-025",
    "number": 10,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p012",
    "quote": "宣公七年，魯弒其君隱公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0800-0701/bce-0710.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-026",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p012",
    "quote": "九年，宋督弒其君殤公，及孔父。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0800-0701/bce-0709.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-8",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-027",
    "number": 8,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p012",
    "quote": "十年，晉曲沃莊伯弒其君哀侯。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0800-0701/bce-0701.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-10",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-028",
    "number": 10,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p013",
    "quote": "十八年，初，宣公愛夫人夷姜，夷姜生子伋，以為太子，而令右公子傅之。右公子為太子取齊女，未入室，而宣公見所欲為太子婦者好，說而自取之，更為太子取他女。宣公得齊女，生子壽、子朔，令左公子傅之。太子伋母死，宣公正夫人與朔共讒惡太子伋。宣公自以其奪太子妻也，心惡太子，欲廢之。及聞其惡，大怒，乃使太子伋於齊而令盜遮界上殺之，與太子白旄，而告界盜見持白旄者殺之。且行，子朔之兄壽，太子異母弟也，知朔之惡太子而君欲殺之，乃謂太子曰：「界盜見太子白旄，即殺太子，太子可毋行。」太子曰：「逆父命求生，不可。」遂行。壽見太子不止，乃盜其白旄而先馳至界。界盜見其驗，即殺之。壽已死，而太子伋又至，謂盜曰：「所當殺乃我也。」盜并殺太子伋，以報宣公。宣公乃以子朔為太子。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0700.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-029",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p013",
    "quote": "十九年，宣公卒，太子朔立，是為惠公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0696.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-6",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-030",
    "number": 6,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p014",
    "quote": "左右公子不平朔之立也，惠公四年，左右公子怨惠公之讒殺前太子伋而代立，乃作亂，攻惠公，立太子伋之弟黔牟為君，惠公奔齊。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0688.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-031",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p015",
    "quote": "衛君黔牟立八年，齊襄公率諸侯奉王命共伐衛，納衛惠公，誅左右公子。衛君黔牟奔于周，惠公復立。惠公立三年出亡，亡八年復入，與前通年凡十三年矣。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0675.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-5",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-032",
    "number": 5,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p016",
    "quote": "二十五年，惠公怨周之容舍黔牟，與燕伐周。周惠王奔溫，衛、燕立惠王弟穨為王。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0673.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-033",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p016",
    "quote": "二十九年，鄭復納惠王。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0669.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-034",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p016",
    "quote": "三十一年，惠公卒，子懿公赤立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0660.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-7",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-035",
    "number": 7,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p017",
    "quote": "懿公即位，好鶴，淫樂奢侈。九年，翟伐衛，衛懿公欲發兵，兵或畔。大臣言曰：「君好鶴，鶴可令擊翟。」翟於是遂入，殺懿公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0660.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-8",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-036",
    "number": 8,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p018",
    "quote": "懿公之立也，百姓大臣皆不服。自懿公父惠公朔之讒殺太子伋代立至於懿公，常欲敗之，卒滅惠公之後而更立黔牟之弟昭伯頑之子申為君，是為戴公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0660.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-8",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-037",
    "number": 8,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p019",
    "quote": "戴公申元年卒。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0659.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-9",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-038",
    "number": 9,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p019",
    "quote": "立戴公弟燬為衛君，是為文公。文公以亂故奔齊，齊人入之。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0658.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-039",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p019",
    "quote": "齊桓公以衛數亂，乃率諸侯伐翟，為衛筑楚丘，",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0660.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-8",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-040",
    "number": 8,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p020",
    "quote": "初，翟殺懿公也，衛人憐之，思復立宣公前死太子伋之後，伋子又死，而代伋死者子壽又無子。太子伋同母弟二人：其一曰黔牟，黔牟嘗代惠公為君，八年復去；其二曰昭伯。昭伯、黔牟皆已前死，故立昭伯子申為戴公。戴公卒，復立其弟燬為文公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0660.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-9",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-041",
    "number": 9,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p021",
    "quote": "文公初立，輕賦平罪，身自勞，與百姓同苦，以收衛民。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0644.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-8",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-042",
    "number": 8,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p022",
    "quote": "十六年，晉公子重耳過，無禮。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0643.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-5",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-043",
    "number": 5,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p022",
    "quote": "十七年，齊桓公卒。",
    "reused_existing_quote": true
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0635.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-8",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-044",
    "number": 8,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p022",
    "quote": "二十五年，文公卒，子成公鄭立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0632.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-045",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p023",
    "quote": "成公三年，晉欲假道於衛救宋，成公不許。晉更從南河度，救宋。徵師於衛，衛大夫欲許，成公不肯。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0632.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-9",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-046",
    "number": 9,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p023",
    "quote": "大夫元咺攻成公，成公出奔。晉文公重耳伐衛，分其地予宋，討前過無禮及不救宋患也。衛成公遂出奔陳。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0630.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-047",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p023",
    "quote": "二歲，如周求入，與晉文公會。晉使人鴆衛成公，成公私於周主鴆，令薄，得不死。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0630.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-048",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p023",
    "quote": "已而周為請晉文公，卒入之衛，而誅元咺，衛君瑕出奔。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0628.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-049",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p023",
    "quote": "七年，晉文公卒。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0623.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-11",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-050",
    "number": 11,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p023",
    "quote": "十二年，成公朝晉襄公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0621.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-051",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p023",
    "quote": "十四年，秦穆公卒。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0609.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-052",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p023",
    "quote": "二十六年，齊邴歜弒其君懿公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0600.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-8",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-053",
    "number": 8,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p023",
    "quote": "三十五年，成公卒，子穆公遫立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0598.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-6",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-054",
    "number": 6,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p024",
    "quote": "穆公二年，楚莊王伐陳，殺夏徵舒。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0597.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-055",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p024",
    "quote": "三年，楚莊王圍鄭，鄭降，復釋之。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0589.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-056",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p024",
    "quote": "十一年，孫良夫救魯伐齊，復得侵地。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0589.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-7",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-057",
    "number": 7,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p024",
    "quote": "穆公卒，子定公臧立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0577.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-5",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-058",
    "number": 5,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p024",
    "quote": "定公十二年卒，子獻公衎立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0564.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-13",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-059",
    "number": 13,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p025",
    "quote": "獻公十三年，公令師曹教宮妾鼓琴，妾不善，曹笞之。妾以幸惡曹於公，公亦笞曹三百。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0559.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-8",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-060",
    "number": 8,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p025",
    "quote": "十八年，獻公戒孫文子、甯惠子食，皆往。日旰不召，而去射鴻於囿。二子從之，公不釋射服與之言。二子怒，如宿。孫文子子數侍公飲，使師曹歌巧言之卒章。師曹又怒公之嘗笞三百，乃歌之，欲以怒孫文子，報衛獻公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0559.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-9",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-061",
    "number": 9,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p025",
    "quote": "文子語蘧伯玉，伯玉曰：「臣不知也。」遂攻出獻公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0559.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-10",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-062",
    "number": 10,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p025",
    "quote": "獻公奔齊，齊置衛獻公於聚邑。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0559.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-12",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-063",
    "number": 12,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p025",
    "quote": "孫文子、甯惠子共立定公弟秋為衛君，是為殤公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0558.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-12",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-064",
    "number": 12,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p026",
    "quote": "殤公秋立，封孫文子林父於宿。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0547.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-065",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p026",
    "quote": "十二年，甯喜與孫林父爭寵相惡，殤公使甯喜攻孫林父。林父奔晉，復求入故衛獻公。獻公在齊，齊景公聞之，與衛獻公如晉求入。晉為伐衛，誘與盟。衛殤公會晉平公，平公執殤公與甯喜而復入衛獻公。獻公亡在外十二年而入。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0546.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-066",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p027",
    "quote": "獻公後元年，誅甯喜。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0544.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-14",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-067",
    "number": 14,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p028",
    "quote": "三年，吳延陵季子使過衛，見蘧伯玉、史，曰：「衛多君子，其國無故。」過宿，孫林父為擊磬，曰：「不樂，音大悲，使衛亂乃此矣。」",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0544.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-6",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-068",
    "number": 6,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p028",
    "quote": "是年，獻公卒，子襄公惡立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0538.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-069",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p029",
    "quote": "襄公六年，楚靈王會諸侯，襄公稱病不往。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0535.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-10",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-070",
    "number": 10,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p030",
    "quote": "九年，襄公卒。初，襄公有賤妾，幸之，有身，夢有人謂曰：「我康叔也，令若子必有衛，名而子曰『元』。」妾怪之，問孔成子。成子曰：「康叔者，衛祖也。」及生子，男也，以告襄公。襄公曰：「天所置也。」名之曰元。襄公夫人無子，於是乃立元為嗣，是為靈公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0530.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj037-ling-jin-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-071",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p031",
    "quote": "靈公五年，朝晉昭公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0529.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-072",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p031",
    "quote": "六年，楚公子弃疾弒靈王自立，爲平王。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0600-0501/bce-0524.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-073",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p031",
    "quote": "十一年，火。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0497.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-074",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p032",
    "quote": "三十八年，孔子來，祿之如魯。後有隙，孔子去。後復來。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0496.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-8",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-075",
    "number": 8,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p033",
    "quote": "三十九年，太子蒯聵與靈公夫人南子有惡，欲殺南子。蒯聵與其徒戲陽遬謀，朝，使殺夫人。戲陽後悔，不果。蒯聵數目之，夫人覺之，懼，呼曰：「太子欲殺我！」靈公怒，太子蒯聵犇宋，已而之晉趙氏。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0493.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-076",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p034",
    "quote": "四十二年春，靈公游于郊，令子郢仆。郢，靈公少子也，字子南。靈公怨太子出奔，謂郢曰：「我將立若為後。」郢對曰：「郢不足以辱社稷，君更圖之。」夏，靈公卒，夫人命子郢為太子，曰：「此靈公命也。」郢曰：「亡人太子蒯聵之子輒在也，不敢當。」於是衛乃以輒為君，是為出公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0493.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-077",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p035",
    "quote": "六月乙酉，趙簡子欲入蒯聵，乃令陽虎詐命衛十餘人衰绖歸，簡子送蒯聵。衛人聞之，發兵擊蒯聵。蒯聵不得入，入宿而保，衛人亦罷兵。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0489.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-5",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-078",
    "number": 5,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p036",
    "quote": "出公輒四年，齊田乞弒其君孺子。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0485.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-079",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p036",
    "quote": "八年，齊鮑子弒其君悼公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0484.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-7",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-080",
    "number": 7,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p037",
    "quote": "孔子自陳入衛。九年，孔文子問兵於仲尼，仲尼不對。其後魯迎仲尼，仲尼反魯。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0480.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-6",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-081",
    "number": 6,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p038",
    "quote": "十二年，初，孔圉文子取太子蒯聵之姊，生悝。孔氏之豎渾良夫美好，孔文子卒，良夫通於悝母。太子在宿，悝母使良夫於太子。太子與良夫言曰：「茍能入我國，報子以乘軒，免子三死，毋所與。」與之盟，許以悝母為妻。閏月，良夫與太子入，舍孔氏之外圃。昏，二人蒙衣而乘，宦者羅御，如孔氏。孔氏之老欒甯問之，稱姻妾以告。遂入，適伯姬氏。既食，悝母杖戈而先，太子與五人介，輿猳從之。伯姬劫悝於廁，彊盟之，遂劫以登臺。欒甯將飲酒，炙未熟，聞亂，使告仲由。召護駕乘車，行爵食炙，奉出公輒奔魯。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0480.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-7",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-082",
    "number": 7,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p039",
    "quote": "仲由將入，遇子羔將出，曰：「門已閉矣。」子路曰：「吾姑至矣。」子羔曰：「不及，莫踐其難。」子路曰：「食焉不辟其難。」子羔遂出。子路入，及門，公孫敢闔門，曰：「毋入為也！」子路曰：「是公孫也？求利而逃其難。由不然，利其祿，必救其患。」有使者出，子路乃得入。曰：「太子焉用孔悝？雖殺之，必或繼之。」且曰：「太子無勇。若燔臺，必舍孔叔。」太子聞之，懼，下石乞、盂黶敵子路，以戈擊之，割纓。子路曰：「君子死，冠不免。」結纓而死。孔子聞衛亂，曰：「嗟乎！柴也其來乎？由也其死矣。」孔悝竟立太子蒯聵，是為莊公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0480.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-7",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-083",
    "number": 7,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p040",
    "quote": "莊公蒯聵者，出公父也，居外，怨大夫莫迎立。元年即位，欲盡誅大臣，曰：「寡人居外久矣，子亦嘗聞之乎？」群臣欲作亂，乃止。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0479.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-084",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p041",
    "quote": "二年，魯孔丘卒。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0478.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-6",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-085",
    "number": 6,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p042",
    "quote": "三年，莊公上城，見戎州。曰：「戎虜何為是？」戎州病之。十月，戎州告趙簡子，簡子圍衛。十一月，莊公出奔，衛人立公子斑師為衛君。齊伐衛，虜斑師，更立公子起為衛君。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0477.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-086",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p043",
    "quote": "衛君起元年，衛石曼尃逐其君起，起奔齊。衛出公輒自齊復歸立。初，出公立十二年亡，亡在外四年復入。出公後元年，賞從亡者。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0469.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-087",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p043",
    "quote": "立二十一年卒，出公季父黔攻出公子而自立，是為悼公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0450.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj015-0450-wei-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-088",
    "number": null,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p044",
    "quote": "悼公五年卒，子敬公弗立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0432.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-089",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p044",
    "quote": "敬公十九年卒，子昭公糾立。是時三晉彊，衛如小侯，屬之。",
    "reused_existing_quote": true
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0426.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj037-zhao-death-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-090",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p045",
    "quote": "昭公六年，公子亹弒之代立，是為懷公。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0500-0401/bce-0415.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj037-huai-death-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-091",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p045",
    "quote": "懷公十一年，公子穨弒懷公而代立，是為慎公。慎公父，公子適；適父，敬公也。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0373.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-092",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p045",
    "quote": "慎公四十二年卒，子聲公訓立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0362.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-8",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-093",
    "number": 5,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p045",
    "quote": "聲公十一年卒，子成侯遫立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": true
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0361.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-094",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p046",
    "quote": "成侯十一年，公孫鞅入秦。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0346.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-095",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p046",
    "quote": "十六年，衛更貶號曰侯。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0333.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-096",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p047",
    "quote": "二十九年，成侯卒，子平侯立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0325.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-097",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p047",
    "quote": "平侯八年卒，子嗣君立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0400-0301/bce-0320.md",
    "note_anchor": "sj037-si-title-note",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-098",
    "number": 6,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p048",
    "quote": "嗣君五年，更貶號曰君，獨有濮陽。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0283.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-099",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p049",
    "quote": "四十二年卒，子懷君立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": true
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0252.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-100",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p049",
    "quote": "懷君三十一年，朝魏，魏囚殺懷君。魏更立嗣君弟，是為元君。元君為魏婿，故魏立之。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0242.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-1",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-101",
    "number": 1,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p049",
    "quote": "元君十四年，秦拔魏東地，秦初置東郡，更徙衛野王縣，而并濮陽為東郡。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0241.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-102",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p049",
    "quote": "元君十四年，秦拔魏東地，秦初置東郡，更徙衛野王縣，而并濮陽為東郡。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0230.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-103",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p049",
    "quote": "二十五年，元君卒，子君角立。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0229.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-3",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-104",
    "number": 3,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p049",
    "quote": "君角九年，秦并天下，立為始皇帝。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0221.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-4",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-105",
    "number": 4,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p049",
    "quote": "君角九年，秦并天下，立為始皇帝。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0209.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-33",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-106",
    "number": 33,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p049",
    "quote": "二十一年，二世廢君角為庶人，衛絕祀。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0800-0701/bce-0701.md",
    "note_anchor": "reading-note-10",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-107",
    "number": 10,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "p050",
    "quote": "太史公曰：余讀世家言，至於宣公之太子以婦見誅，弟壽爭死以相讓，此與晉太子申生不敢明驪姬之過同，俱惡傷父之志。然卒死亡，何其悲也！或父子相殺，兄弟相滅，亦獨何哉？",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0300-0201/bce-0209.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-33",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-108",
    "number": 33,
    "source_path": "sources/摘录/史记-卷037-卫康叔世家.md",
    "source_anchor": "z001",
    "quote": "【索隱述贊】司寇受封，梓材有作。成錫厥器，夷加其爵。暨武能脩，從文始約。詩美歸燕，傳矜石碏。皮冠射鴻，乘軒使穀。宣縱淫嬖，釁生伋、朔。蒯聵得罪，出公行惡。衛祚日衰，失於君角。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  },
  {
    "path": "years/bce-0700-0601/bce-0630.md",
    "note_anchor": "note-2",
    "placement_anchor": "sj037-cite-109",
    "number": 2,
    "source_path": "sources/春秋左传/有标点原文/bce-0630.md",
    "source_anchor": "t003",
    "quote": "晋侯使医衍酖卫侯。甯俞货医，使薄其酖，不死。公为之请，纳玉于王与晋侯，皆十瑴。王许之。",
    "reused_existing_quote": false
  }
]
